          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>
  I'd like to have some bidirectional syncing with Apple
  Reminders/Calendar so that I can interface with Siri to add
  reminders to my forester, as well as get notifications for things I
  set as due in my forest.
</html:p>
            <html:p>
  Implemented via native AppleScript (osascript) in <html:code>forester-org.el</html:code>.
  No third-party CLI tools needed. Push/pull sync creates items in the
  native Reminders and Calendar apps, which automatically sync to all
  Apple devices via iCloud.
</html:p>
